{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to a doomed world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a cruel and merciless world, try to survive icy storms and creatures from your worst nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dare to defy the Shadows and bring back the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether single-player or cooperative multiplayer, enjoy a unique experience thanks to procedural generation,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But above all, listen to the breath of the wind, the long sigh of the night, and the murmur of the swallows....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hostile, procedurally-generated world, organized into regions you can influence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Severe weather events, requiring you to anticipate your movements and take advantage of natural shelters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join your Steam friends' games with up to 6 players for a cooperative experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own structures to protect yourself and prepare your expeditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advance your skills according to your actions and play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and upgrade equipment to match your ambitions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect your combat by timing your blocks and dodges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Blown Leaves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blown Leaves is an independent development studio located near Lille in Northern France. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To contact us: contact@blownleaves.fr</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2496090?t=1740669204","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2496090?t=1740669204","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat